 "description": "<h2>Product Description</h2>\n<p>This magnetic charging cable is designed for rose toys that use magnetic contact charging, replacing a lost or damaged cable so your toy stays ready for use. It is offered in black and white, with six magnet spacing options ranging from 5mm to 10mm to match the charging contacts of your device. The cable connects to a standard USB power source such as a wall adapter, power bank or computer port. Please confirm the magnet spacing of your original cable before ordering to ensure a correct fit.</p>\n<p>Product Details:<br />Item type: magnetic charging cable<br />Color: Black/White<br />Size: Magnet Spacing 5mm/6mm/7mm/8mm/9mm/10mm</p>\n",
